  "title": {
   "en": "Inagara Tsurizumu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "いながらツーリズム"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "You may not have the time, but you still want to travel!\n\nFor those who’ve become distant from traveling for various reasons, there’s a way to enjoy the feeling of being on a trip without leaving home. That’s right… the antenna shop!\n\nFrom Hokkaido to Okinawa, these stores offer a variety of regional specialties, and by picking up souvenirs, you can immerse yourself in the vibe of your chosen destination—all from the comfort of your own home!",
   "ja": "ヒマはなくとも旅行したい！\n様々な理由で旅行から縁遠くなった人もいる今、家にいながら旅行気分が味わえる場所がある。それが…アンテナショップ！\n北海道から沖縄まで、各都府県の名物が揃ったお店を巡ってお土産を買ったら自宅で旅先気分を堪能しちゃえるのです！"
  },
